  "worked_solution": "To obtain the unit vector that is parallel to $m$, we divide $m$ by its length:\n\n$$\nu=\\frac{m}{|\\,m\\,|}=\\frac{1}{(\\frac{7}{2})}m=\\frac{2}{7}m\n$$",
